{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4b0aa09ad3d3c25a93e311294777f93a167d3c6b689fdbbad6c619a29a9c7b80", "ja": "（39プロジェクト。この壮大な計画を成功させるには\n765プロアイドル全員の協力が欠かせない）", "zh": "（39PROJECT，想让这个宏大的企划成功，\n就需要765艺能所有的偶像携手合作。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f9283d547e0328d016b0c9a2e224cd4827bfabbeb51d2db7ebfc7629a1676886", "ja": "（というわけで、美希に計画の内容を\n説明してみたのだが……）", "zh": "（因此，我试着向美希\n说明了企划的内容，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "d7fb721af4626a42f75c3a84108bef1404b614ebbe23620f8ecdfe9e6349ff48", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ。\nがんばってね、{$P$}☆", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。\n要加油喔，{$P$}☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "280e7731b70fbcea417758f358d217d842ac8bbb0df054bad333641d7c3a1380", "ja": "いや、他人事じゃないぞ。新人が入ってくるって\nことは、美希が先輩になるってことなんだ。", "zh": "不不不，感觉你一副事不关己的样子。\n有新人进来，就代表美希也是前辈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "26dce02ecb388e677652037f203eae456611dd790a0349703316de06fdb10419", "ja": "だから、美希にももう少し、\n先輩らしくしてもらいたいんだけど……。", "zh": "所以我希望美希，\n能够更有一点前辈的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "cfff30090367c3f338a045e994397c012366590ac92966456494789be99323bf", "ja": "センパイらしく？\nわかったの。ミキ、やってみるね。", "zh": "前辈的样子？\n好吧，美希试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "79576606c23397014aedd826094ce42b4d01763d8614d78ee7264193f18a0b9c", "ja": "{$P$}、パン買ってきて！\nミキ、いちごロールがいいな♪", "zh": "{$P$}，去买面包！\n美希想吃草莓蛋糕卷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2cfde8e3fd80845cb2ba724338434a63ea1b0a9af99aa1a1a3a01ff9ff048c12", "ja": "俺に先輩ぶってどうする……。というか、\n後輩を使うんじゃなく、面倒みてあげて欲しいんだ。", "zh": "在我面前装前辈做什么……不对啦，\n我不是要你使唤新人，是要你照顾她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "1bf662c2a83ae3c89bcfee302ec12183bf982b0436052cda2d31589f429820fc", "ja": "ここの支払いは、ミキに任せてね。\nミキの支払いは、律子に任せてね♪", "zh": "这笔帐就让美希来付。\n美希的帐就交给律子付啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "97ebc7b9cca8eddef9617d6314f0af47c00755304a2db89a5ba1d65e439eb850", "ja": "美希は何ひとつ任されてないような……。\nあと、律子に聞かれたら大変だぞ？", "zh": "感觉美希根本没付到半毛钱……\n还有，要是被律子听到可有你受的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "61e1d7b136b1cc0bb620997aed6247ae0f1172ff9388f08415fb6fda258d75ca", "ja": "もっと美希自身に、お手本になるような、\n立派な先輩になって欲しいってことなんだ。", "zh": "我是希望美希能再主动一些，\n当个值得大家效法的好前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "5614661c87f662f6afe90ea7c8b874c6c30370a786a0e2da0e9391a324b14b8f", "ja": "ミキをお手本にしたら、毎日みんなでお昼寝だね。\n楽しい夢、一緒に見られるといいな♪", "zh": "学美希的话，那大家就会天天一起睡午觉呢。\n希望可以一起做有趣的梦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9edb32ca52725d3126dbbe87422f981205c041cab573fa03ad34fa568c328db9", "ja": "……そうなるよな。\nそして俺は、悪夢を見るハメに……。", "zh": "……我想也是。\n然后我的恶梦就要来临了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_1013", "source_sha256": "f3c4e4a9c32c736250ac4a38fe7c8b82d42c968d9d04687061c867f28c3140b8", "ja": "よし、やめよう", "zh": "好，放弃吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8f884b1603c536ebf7efc29d419f28181a07de56f1c8f5778a4fa71f46a6389d", "ja": "よし、無理に先輩ぶるのはやめておこう。\n美希は今まで通り、頑張ってくれ。", "zh": "好，我就不勉强你要当个前辈了。\n美希就像平常一样加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_2001_003mik", "source_sha256": "afd0aad3b4258a391d262e32788a1c046170aa1230ac15fabb0d3697168aff5e", "ja": "うんっ。ミキ的にも、それがいいって思うな。\nセンパイになっても、ミキはミキだし。", "zh": "嗯！美希也觉得这样才好。\n就算成了前辈，美希也还是美希嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "d1a483168468546772de3bc63297934d802225c507e040465fa781a12ad0f8a0", "ja": "とりあえず、学校みたいなカンジになりそうだから、\n学校みたいにやってみるね。", "zh": "总之，之后大家相处应该会像在学校那样，\n美希就用这个方式试试看唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "c11f0fddf1ec734b7f47c917c8270800be36c86c45c5cd022f8e95a584a43f84", "ja": "ああ、それでいいと思う。\nよろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得这样不错。\n麻烦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_2004_003mik", "source_sha256": "5fbbfd8693fc0d48362d135c9d5032ac5c5b4e3e398ae08fa646c71774f46605", "ja": "はいなの！\n……あ、それからー。", "zh": "好的唷！\n……啊，还有件事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
