{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_2011_003mik", "source_sha256": "164342a4f33106e55af54aa50e5e2fe092f2e3add2994a71b7d9731076b1f92b", "ja": "見ててね、{$P$}。\nミキ、カンタンには負けないから。…あはっ☆", "zh": "看着吧，{$P$}。\n美希不会轻易认输的……啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_003mik_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_001_2012_p", "source_sha256": "9139227cd552ff3401be08b2e669b27b3616d274412d391abf6abda01e479bf3", "ja": "（新人達は事務所の仲間……。\nだけど、競い合うライバルでもある）", "zh": "（新人们虽是事务所的伙伴……\n但彼此也互为竞争对手。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
